1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:02,960
Finding Dad is not the key.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:06,240
The key is to find out if that woman
killed Chung.

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:10,080
What if she's connected to Chung's death?

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,320
She will be stripped of her right
of inheritance.

5
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:15,280
My wife didn't kill Chung B.

6
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,600
Hello, folks.

7
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:24,960
According to the record the Police
obtained from the smart watch company,

8
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:27,600
Mr. Cheung Siu-chung's heartbeat stopped

9
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:31,160
at 12:05 a.m. on October 16.

10
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:34,480
That means he was 21 years old when he died

11
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:37,360
and he was entitled to inherit
Mr. Cheung Kin-kwok's estate.

12
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:41,040
Therefore, the trust fund he set up

13
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:44,560
will take effect after the probate
is completed.

14
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,160
The allocation of assets is as follows...

15
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:51,280
Mr. Mok, when will I officially
become the owner of the house?

16
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:54,240
How soon will the trust fund take effect?

17
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:56,240
At least three months.

18
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:58,800
That long?

19
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:01,920
Mr. Cheung Siu-chung inherited
a huge estate.

20
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,760
It will take a while to process.

21
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,080
Do you have any questions?

22
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,280
Just make it quick.

23
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:10,160
I can't wait to spend the money.

24
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:12,240
Chung B was so sweet

25
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:15,920
to leave his mother such a generous gift.

26
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,840
Mr. Mok, I'm leaving if
there's nothing else.

27
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,920
Mr. Mok, I'm leaving too.

28
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:30,320
Hello? Yes, I need a taxi.

29
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:34,480
I can't watch that tramp inherit
the house without a fight.

30
00:02:35,440 --> 00:02:39,000
Mr. Mok, can you tell me,

31
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:41,280
if Leung Yuet-ping did anything bad,

32
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,120
can she be disqualified

33
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,840
and won't get the money

34
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:48,240
or get the house?

35
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,760
What do you mean by anything bad?

36
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:53,840
What if she's connected to Chung's death?

37
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,200
If Mr. Cheung Siu-chung's death
was caused by Ms. Leung,

38
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:59,760
she will be stripped of her right
of inheritance.

39
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:03,680
Then I must follow her
and see if she was the killer.

40
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:13,200
Follow the taxi ahead.

41
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,000
Hey, don't lose it.

42
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,840
Hurry up, faster.

43
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:27,200
Run the light. I'll give you $500 more.

44
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:32,960
Is that necessary? The guy ran a red light.

45
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,480
Mother is following me?

46
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,920
She wants to find Chi.

47
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:46,160
Driver, let me off at the mall.

48
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:50,120
Stop the car.

49
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:02,560
Tai-di...

50
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:09,000
I saw you just now. But you kept going.

51
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:11,200
I was following that woman

52
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,040
hoping to find Chi.

53
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:17,120
Now she got away and there's no sign of her.

54
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:19,680
I know. I saw you.

55
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:22,400
Finding Dad is not the key.

56
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:26,320
The key is to find out if that woman
killed Chung.

57
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:28,320
Why would you think that?

58
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,640
Tell me, that night at the village house,

59
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:31,840
you shoved Chung and he fell, right?

60
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:33,200
Did he run into anything?

61
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,400
The glass cabinet.

62
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:36,520
Why do you ask?

63
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:39,760
At the mourning hall when you chased her,

64
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:42,400
she looked scared and what did she say?

65
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:46,240
Chung's head hit the cabinet because of you!

66
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:48,080
You shoved him into the glass cabinet.

67
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,440
You meant to kill him.

68
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,880
Glass cabinet?

69
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:55,840
She said she didn't go to the village house

70
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,840
How else would she know about
the glass cabinet?

71
00:04:57,960 --> 00:05:01,920
Exactly! I was there and I know.

72
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,200
If she was never there,

73
00:05:03,320 --> 00:05:04,560
how did she know about it?

74
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,640
She was lying.

75
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:09,040
That means she went to the village house.

76
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,360
She was connected to Chung's death!

77
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:14,160
It's possible. But we need proof.

78
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:16,480
That's what I intend to find out myself.

79
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,520
When I have enough,

80
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:19,360
I'll pass it to the Police.

81
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,520
What did you find out?

82
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:24,400
I left the law firm early, right?

83
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:27,040
I know that woman always calls for a taxi.

84
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:29,920
That's why I intend to start with the taxi.

85
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:33,120
But I saw you two come downstairs
one after another.

86
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:35,520
And you followed her in a taxi.

87
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:36,880
I didn't know what you intend to do,

88
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:38,800
then I saw you both got off the taxi.

89
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:41,280
So I decided to check out her taxi.

90
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,440
That's why I didn't brush you off.

91
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:44,560
But I didn't have time...

92
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:47,280
The customer wanted to go to Ho King Hotel
but she got out halfway there.

93
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:52,400
I see. What happened next?

94
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:55,360
I didn't exactly come back empty handed.

95
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,840
You're a good driver.

96
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,920
Better safe than sorry.

97
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:02,720
I always need a taxi,

98
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:05,040
can I call you directly?

99
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:06,480
You keep regular customers?

100
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:08,200
I don't take direct calls.

101
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:09,920
Here's my card.

102
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:12,200
Call the group chief if you need a ride.

103
00:06:12,320 --> 00:06:13,920
He'll inform the group of drivers.

104
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:16,960
Whoever is closest to your location
will get the order.

105
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:22,320
I found out the woman may get
a different taxi each time.

106
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,640
So I posed as a regular customer

107
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:27,440
and called the group chief.

108
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:34,200
Hi, I called for a ride to Wan Mei Village
the other night.

109
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,440
When I got out of the car,

110
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:37,360
I left an important letter behind.

111
00:06:37,520 --> 00:06:39,200
I need to contact the driver.

112
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:42,320
When? October 15...

113
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,160
between 11p.m. and midnight.

114
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,400
Yes...

115
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,400
I'll leave you my number.

116
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,920
Please call me back ASAP.

117
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:51,760
Did you hear from the driver?

118
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,400
Not yet. It's a long shot anyway.

119
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:56,400
If the driver calls back,

120
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:59,920
then it means Leung Yuet-ping
was at the village house

121
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:02,720
and she may be connected to Chung's death.

122
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:05,760
You suspected me before,

123
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:08,160
why are you telling me this?

124
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:10,200
Why do you think I suspect you?

125
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:12,560
I saw you going through my things.

126
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:26,160
Yes, I checked your phone

127
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,920
because I wanted to find a picture.

128
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:30,080
Since you already know,

129
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:33,280
can I borrow it and look at the picture?

130
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:35,600
Why didn't you just ask me? Here.

131
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:38,400
Why sneak around and go through my phone?

132
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:42,240
I barely know you. Can't ask you directly.

133
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:46,720
Here...look at this.

134
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:49,320
Why are you showing me the picture?

135
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,560
The jacket.

136
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:53,640
The Police found it in your room

137
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:57,040
I get a feeling something was not right.

138
00:07:57,200 --> 00:08:00,000
Then I finally remembered.

139
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:03,680
Look at the edge, it had a row of pearls.

140
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:07,280
But the one the Police found did not.

141
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:11,040
No wonder!

142
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:13,920
The first time I wanted to toss it,

143
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:16,240
Chi caught me in the act.

144
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:18,320
I threw it away the second time,

145
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,720
but the Police found it again.

146
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,920
It wasn't even the same one.

147
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,400
Go show that to the Police.

148
00:08:24,520 --> 00:08:26,960
Not yet. This isn't enough.

149
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:29,280
Besides, I only took a glance.

150
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:31,360
I can't be sure I didn't see it wrong.

151
00:08:31,520 --> 00:08:37,800
Anyway, at least you care enough

152
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:39,600
to do something about it.

153
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:41,920
Unlike the others who made me out

154
00:08:42,040 --> 00:08:44,400
to be a vicious murderer.

155
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:46,640
I know you loved Chung very much.

156
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,880
Even without this picture,

157
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:52,000
I don't believe you'd kill him.

158
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,560
When I was looking for you
on Tap Tung Island,

159
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:56,160
a villager told me

160
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:58,960
someone was looking into
giving her grandson a burial at sea.

161
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,800
I knew it was you right away.

162
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:05,280
A lot happened these past few months.

163
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:09,360
My husband and my daughter-in-law
had an affair,

164
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,800
my grandson was not my grandson

165
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,720
and wanted to fight me for the inheritance.

166
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,360
As the wife of the village chief,

167
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,760
I became a murder suspect.

168
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,600
The villagers doubted me,

169
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:24,720
my cousin Nam and Chau, my maid
of over 20 years betrayed me.

170
00:09:24,880 --> 00:09:30,800
But my granddaughter, who has
never been close to me,

171
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:34,920
understood the injustice
and offered to help me.

172
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:38,320
Life can be so unpredictable.

173
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:43,600
In this house, Chung was closest to me.

174
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:46,480
Now that he's gone,

175
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:50,880
I guess he would have been worried
about you and Dad the most.

176
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:55,120
I will help you watch over them.

177
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:04,920
The taxi driver still hasn't called back.

178
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:09,680
Let me call the group chief and
get his number.

179
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,080
Hello?

180
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:17,440
Driver, I'm a regular customer
of your taxi group.

181
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:19,200
On the night of October 15,

182
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:21,680
you took me to Wan Mei Village.

183
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:24,560
I did not. Is this a scam?

184
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:28,320
No, the group chief checked
the orders that night.

185
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:30,920
He said it was you and gave me
your number.

186
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:34,320
Say no more. You're an imposter.

187
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:37,200
How rude of him!

188
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:39,120
You were supposed to be a regular customer.

189
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:41,920
He knew I was an imposter
as soon as he picked up the phone.

190
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
Did he see through me?

191
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:46,080
How come?

192
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:49,520
He'll know if he called that woman directly.

193
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:52,320
Rats! I overlooked that.

194
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:54,800
We have no more leads?

195
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,360
Luckily, the driver called me.

196
00:10:57,520 --> 00:11:01,040
Hello, I'm the driver of WK206.

197
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:03,680
Are you the customer who
went to Wan Mei Village?

198
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,600
I checked the car,

199
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,680
I didn't find any letter you left behind.

200
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:09,040
What are you talking about?

201
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,640
Who are you calling?

202
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:12,000
Didn't you call the taxi group

203
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,520
and said you rode with me to Wan Mei Village

204
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,880
and left something in my car

205
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,800
and wanted to find the driver?

206
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,000
That was me.

207
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,680
No, I didn't make any calls.

208
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:23,360
Can you tell me exactly what happened?

209
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:25,280
Someone called the group

210
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:28,800
about October 15 between
11p.m. and midnight,

211
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:31,920
from Ko Cho Village to Wan Mei Village,

212
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,480
she left something important in my car

213
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,640
and wanted to find the driver.

214
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:38,080
That's me.

215
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:41,520
But the Chief left out a digit when
he wrote down the phone number.

216
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:45,440
So he told me to look up the order
and call you back.

217
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:48,000
It wasn't you?

218
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:51,120
But she was very clear on the details
of that night.

219
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:54,560
Maybe it was someone I know.

220
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:56,240
What number did she leave?

221
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:58,480
It only has seven digits.

222
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:00,240
It's OK, just give it to me.

223
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:03,760
5151953...

224
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,600
(Tai-di)

225
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:21,120
5151953...

226
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,320
(Tai-di)

227
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:27,520
OK...sorry, this is someone I know.

228
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:29,680
But she has mental problems

229
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:31,360
and is a stalker.

230
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:34,560
She's checking up on me and harassing me.

231
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:37,680
Do me a favor, if she calls back,

232
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:41,360
please don't tell her anything about me.

233
00:12:41,560 --> 00:12:43,600
I'm worried about my safety.

234
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:46,920
Oh dear! OK, I know what to do.

235
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,480
Thanks, pal.

236
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:51,360
Try to track me down? Think again.

237
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:53,200
Who is it?

238
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:56,400
Don't open the door until you
see who it is.

239
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:02,800
Mom, I missed you! Mom...

240
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:03,920
Chi.

241
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:05,360
I missed you all.

242
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:07,360
Are you scared?

243
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:09,680
We found you even though you're hiding.

244
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:12,040
Tai-di...

245
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,360
Lam, I'm not coming.

246
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:15,600
The customer wanted to go to Ho King Hotel

247
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:16,640
but got off halfway there.

248
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:19,040
Luckily, Tai-di remembered the driver
mentioned Ho King Hotel.

249
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:21,280
You think you can ditch me?

250
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:24,480
Mother and child have an inseparable link.

251
00:13:24,560 --> 00:13:28,080
I can always find him wherever you take him.

252
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:30,080
So what if you can find him?

253
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:33,280
Let's see how you take him away.

254
00:13:33,760 --> 00:13:41,200
Dad, the coffee shop has the best
vanilla sundae.

255
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:45,760
Shall we go down for afternoon tea and talk?

256
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:48,080
Good! I want that.

257
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,600
Let's go down now.

258
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:55,280
It's not that hard.

259
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:04,000
Chi, why did you leave without a word?

260
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,280
I've been calling you

261
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,920
and your phone is turned off.

262
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:09,360
Do you know how much I missed you?

263
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:16,320
I wanted to call you too. But I can't.

264
00:14:16,640 --> 00:14:19,600
I know that.

265
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:23,920
Let's go home after you finish eating.

266
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:26,920
You know how much I missed you?

267
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:28,640
The way you run off like that,

268
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,000
do you want to kill me?

269
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,600
I can't.

270
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:34,720
Why not? Someone won't let you?

271
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:37,120
I just can't.

272
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:44,240
Dad, how long do you want to stay here?

273
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,920
A month.

274
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,360
What?

275
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:50,000
I saw the hotel has a promotion.

276
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,680
If you stay for a month,

277
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:54,080
you can book the Presidential Suite.

278
00:14:54,240 --> 00:14:56,720
Dad, you were being the good son

279
00:14:56,920 --> 00:15:00,080
and knew Grandma likes the palace
style design in the Presidential Suite,

280
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,000
that's why you want to stay a month

281
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,760
and let Grandma stay there for a day?

282
00:15:03,920 --> 00:15:09,280
Oops! They knew. No more surprises.

283
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:12,240
Chi, I know you're a filial son.

284
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:16,480
I don't care if I get to stay in the hotel,

285
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:18,560
as long as I can see you every day,

286
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:21,040
I don't mind living in a partitioned flat.

287
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:23,440
Come home with me, OK?

288
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:25,760
I just can't.

289
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:28,080
Why not?

290
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:31,600
Go ahead. Tell them.

291
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,560
Honey is having a baby.

292
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:35,680
What?

293
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:38,480
If she's not leaving, I'm not leaving.

294
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:41,040
I need to learn to take care of
the teddy bear,

295
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:43,600
so I can look after the baby later.

296
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:46,920
Well? There'll be someone else
to look after Chi.

297
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:49,200
Aren't you happy? Surprised?

298
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:53,520
This baby is Chung B.

299
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:57,760
He wants to be my son again.

300
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:02,720
Tummy ache. I need to use the toilet.

301
00:16:02,840 --> 00:16:04,480
I'll go with you.

302
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:11,200
You think it's real?

303
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:13,120
I think it's her excuse.

304
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:16,080
She wants Chi to stay here

305
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:17,520
and won't let him go home.

306
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:19,040
Something is fishy.

307
00:16:19,160 --> 00:16:20,320
I agree.

308
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:23,520
But we can't let Dad stay here indefinitely.

309
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,520
We must find a way to verify

310
00:16:25,680 --> 00:16:27,440
if that woman is pregnant.

311
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,520
She left the room key. I'll search the room.

312
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:33,360
Look for name cards of gynecologists,

313
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:34,640
napkins or pregnancy tests...

314
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,000
I will.

315
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:38,320
Wait, Grandma...

316
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:41,280
Is it one line or two lines?

317
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:44,080
Don't you know? How can you be a lawyer?

318
00:16:44,200 --> 00:16:45,560
Let me do it.

319
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:12,840
Where's Mother?

320
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:14,800
Since Dad has stomachache,

321
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:16,360
she went out to get him meds.

322
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:18,280
I'll get the bill.

323
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:24,960
Sorry, afternoon tea hours are up.

324
00:17:25,080 --> 00:17:26,640
Can you settle the bill?

325
00:17:26,760 --> 00:17:29,920
Didn't my wife pay for it?

326
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,440
Hello, Tai-di?

327
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:37,880
Grandma, get out! She's coming.

328
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:44,840
Why did you sneak into my room?

329
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:46,240
What are you looking for?

330
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:50,000
Are you scared? What are you hiding?

331
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:53,680
You probably suspect I'm faking my pregnancy

332
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:56,360
and came up to look for any proof
to expose me

333
00:17:56,520 --> 00:17:58,560
and drive a wedge between me and Chi.

334
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,680
So what if I am?

335
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:01,080
You were afraid I'll get answers from Chi.

336
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,640
That's why you moved out in a hurry.

337
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:06,280
A fake pregnancy is a lousy idea.

338
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:08,880
You must have a lot to hide.

339
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:11,920
I will expose you.

340
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:14,160
I won't let you get away with it.

341
00:18:14,320 --> 00:18:16,520
You're no match for me!

342
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:18,360
We'll see.

343
00:18:20,080 --> 00:18:22,240
Ouch...

344
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:29,440
Get me an ambulance!

345
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:34,800
Do I have Leung Yuet-ping's family?

346
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:38,400
I'm her husband.

347
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:41,040
The patient and the baby are fine.

348
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,520
But since the baby is only two weeks old,

349
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:44,720
the mother should be very careful
early in the pregnancy.

350
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:46,080
She does not need to be hospitalized

351
00:18:46,240 --> 00:18:47,840
but should be off her feet this week

352
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,680
and stop running around.

353
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:50,960
Thank you.

354
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:55,600
Honey, are you OK?

355
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:58,480
I'm fine. The doctor said the baby is OK.

356
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:03,120
Hear that? She's not lying.

357
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:06,480
She's really carrying Chi's baby?

358
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:10,400
I've had enough after all these years.

359
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:13,880
I just didn't expect you to hate me so much

360
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,840
you want to hurt your grandchild.

361
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:20,600
Dad, let's go home and talk

362
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:21,440
and sort things out, OK?

363
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:24,560
I'm not going. I'm not going!

364
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:29,640
I'm staying to watch Honey and the baby.

365
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:33,920
I told you I didn't shove her. She lied.

366
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:34,880
You must believe me.

367
00:19:35,040 --> 00:19:38,760
You shoved her. You're the baddie.

368
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:43,200
I don't want to see you. Leave...

369
00:19:43,320 --> 00:19:44,400
Go away...
I did not...

370
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:46,240
Go away...
Are you OK?

371
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:50,160
Go! I don't like you. Go away...

372
00:19:50,320 --> 00:19:52,400
Dad is in a rage. Nothing you say will help.

373
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:53,360
Let's go home, OK?

374
00:19:53,560 --> 00:19:58,520
I don't want to see you.

375
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,080
OK...don't be upset.

376
00:20:00,280 --> 00:20:02,960
That tramp is so calculating.

377
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:06,120
She's always setting a trap for me.

378
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:09,920
What should I do? Chi is angry with me.

379
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:14,120
That's why we must hurry and find
proof she was at the village house.

380
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:16,400
It's the only way to clear your name.

381
00:20:16,520 --> 00:20:20,160
More importantly, let Dad know
who's the real baddie

382
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:23,200
so he'll come home with us.

383
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:26,880
Let's see when she'll show her cloven hoof.

384
00:20:27,440 --> 00:20:29,280
When you went to her room,

385
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,080
did you find anything suspicious?

386
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:33,760
I found a card of a detective agency.

387
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:35,040
(Henry Wong Detective Agency)

388
00:20:35,200 --> 00:20:36,960
I took a picture of it.

389
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:40,800
I wonder why she hired a private detective.

390
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,880
To check on Chung?

391
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:44,120
Let's go find out.

392
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:47,360
Let's pay the private detective.

393
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:50,160
Ask him what that tramp wanted.

394
00:20:50,280 --> 00:20:53,360
They have rules about protecting
the client's privacy

395
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:55,080
and probably signed a
non-disclosure agreement.

396
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:57,440
Paying him won't make him talk.

397
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:59,680
Then what?

398
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:04,040
Hire this guy to check up on me.

399
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:06,360
Then I'll pretend to catch him following me

400
00:21:06,520 --> 00:21:07,880
and take pictures of him.

401
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:10,080
Then we post the pictures online

402
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:12,080
and accuse him of being unprofessional

403
00:21:12,240 --> 00:21:15,200
so he'll never work again.

404
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:16,800
That's not enough.

405
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:19,360
I need to bluff him.

406
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:23,280
According to Section 160 of
Cap 200 Crimes Ordinance,

407
00:21:23,400 --> 00:21:27,360
"if any person loiters in a public place
or in the common parts of any building

408
00:21:27,560 --> 00:21:30,880
and his presence there, causes any person
reasonably to be concerned for his safety,

409
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:34,720
the maximum penalty is imprisonment for
six months and a fine of $10,000.

410
00:21:35,120 --> 00:21:38,480
Wow, you're worthy of being a lawyer,

411
00:21:38,640 --> 00:21:40,880
you know the law by heart.

412
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:55,680
Can I help you?

413
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:58,080
I'm looking for Henry Wong.

414
00:21:58,160 --> 00:21:58,880
That's me.

415
00:21:59,040 --> 00:22:01,520
You?
Please come in.

416
00:22:01,680 --> 00:22:02,840
My office is over here.

417
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:05,200
Please have a seat and talk.

418
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:07,120
How can I help you?

419
00:22:07,160 --> 00:22:08,000
Your husband is having an affair?

420
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:09,560
He has a mistress stashed up somewhere

421
00:22:09,640 --> 00:22:11,320
or he's giving her a monthly allowance?

422
00:22:11,480 --> 00:22:13,080
Check on her.

423
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:14,560
OK, the mistress.

424
00:22:14,680 --> 00:22:16,840
No. She's my granddaughter.

425
00:22:16,920 --> 00:22:19,680
I suspect a man is sponging off her.

426
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:21,000
Go find out.

427
00:22:21,040 --> 00:22:23,200
No problem. I'll open a file for you.

428
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:38,480
Honey, have some tea.

429
00:22:41,080 --> 00:22:43,920
Are you tired?

430
00:22:44,120 --> 00:22:46,400
A little.

431
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:53,080
Pregnant women will get cramps.

432
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,280
How do you know?

433
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:59,440
You were like that when you had Chung B.

434
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:04,400
But don't worry. I'll be with you.

435
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:06,520
I can do anything.

436
00:23:06,680 --> 00:23:10,720
My legs are fine, but not my heart.

437
00:23:10,880 --> 00:23:12,360
You're not feeling well?

438
00:23:12,520 --> 00:23:15,360
Mom said you must go to the hospital
if you're not feeling well.

439
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:19,360
Don't listen to her, you must listen to me.

440
00:23:19,520 --> 00:23:21,120
I don't feel good

441
00:23:21,320 --> 00:23:24,120
because even though I get the house,

442
00:23:24,280 --> 00:23:27,800
you and your mother can stay there
till you pass away.

443
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:30,280
I'm worried.

444
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:33,200
About what?

445
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:35,640
I know you love me and the baby.

446
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:38,840
But what will your mother do to us?

447
00:23:39,040 --> 00:23:44,400
How about that? After Chung's trust fund
becomes effective,

448
00:23:44,560 --> 00:23:46,520
tell your mother to move out.

449
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:48,040
What?

450
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:51,040
I'm afraid the baby will be born
without a father.

451
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:53,360
Your mother only wanted you
to go home with her.

452
00:23:53,520 --> 00:23:54,880
She obviously wanted to separate us.

453
00:23:55,080 --> 00:23:58,480
Then...we can stay here.

454
00:23:58,600 --> 00:24:01,600
I will protect you and the baby.

455
00:24:01,720 --> 00:24:03,920
But I don't want to live in a hotel
for the rest of my life.

456
00:24:04,120 --> 00:24:06,120
That's true.

457
00:24:06,280 --> 00:24:09,080
It's hard to live with someone.

458
00:24:09,240 --> 00:24:11,800
If we don't live together,

459
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:14,880
I won't be fighting with your mother.

460
00:24:15,080 --> 00:24:18,600
She can always visit the baby.

461
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:22,360
So I have to live apart from Mom?

462
00:24:22,480 --> 00:24:25,600
I have never done that before.

463
00:24:25,760 --> 00:24:30,640
Let's rent a house nearby for her.

464
00:24:30,760 --> 00:24:33,320
You can go there and visit her.

465
00:24:33,480 --> 00:24:39,280
Chung's trust fund gave her
a monthly allowance of $50K.

466
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:42,640
You're such a filial son, give her your $30K

467
00:24:42,840 --> 00:24:45,360
and she'll have $80K a month.

468
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:48,640
That's a lot of money, right?

469
00:24:48,760 --> 00:24:56,400
Yes, Mom should be happy she has money
to buy things she likes to eat.

470
00:24:56,520 --> 00:25:01,200
That's why, you must convince her
to move out.

471
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:05,200
Or else I'll move out with the baby

472
00:25:05,280 --> 00:25:06,840
and you'll never see us again.

473
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:10,320
No...I want to play with the baby.

474
00:25:10,480 --> 00:25:13,080
That's why you must listen to me, OK?

475
00:25:13,200 --> 00:25:14,880
I know.

476
00:25:15,320 --> 00:25:16,760
Very good.

477
00:25:20,040 --> 00:25:22,360
What is it?

478
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:23,680
What are you doing here?

479
00:25:23,840 --> 00:25:27,120
You complain I don't take good enough
care of Chi.

480
00:25:27,280 --> 00:25:30,160
Now, I'm doing my best.

481
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:36,160
Honey...

482
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:37,680
Hey, what are you doing?

483
00:25:37,840 --> 00:25:40,000
Hey, open the door!

484
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:42,840
Chi...

485
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:47,440
Honey...
Hey...

486
00:25:47,560 --> 00:25:49,120
Go away!

487
00:25:49,240 --> 00:25:54,600
Chi...

488
00:25:54,680 --> 00:25:58,160
No way! Why don't I ever win the lottery?

489
00:25:58,360 --> 00:26:00,720
This is what I get.

490
00:26:01,280 --> 00:26:03,880
(Terminate pregnancy)

491
00:26:06,520 --> 00:26:11,280
Honey, we're having a baby?

492
00:26:12,040 --> 00:26:13,800
You know how to read the pregnancy test?

493
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:16,600
Mom taught me.

494
00:26:16,760 --> 00:26:22,760
Two red lines means there's a baby.

495
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:25,440
We're having a baby.

496
00:26:25,640 --> 00:26:29,680
Go away! You're good for nothing else.

497
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:33,680
I wonder if it's a boy or a girl.

498
00:26:33,880 --> 00:26:35,360
Let me listen.

499
00:26:35,640 --> 00:26:39,440
Hello! Are you a boy or a girl?

500
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:42,880
Honey, you're back.

501
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:47,360
I want to talk to you...

502
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:50,400
Be quiet. I bought you this.

503
00:26:50,560 --> 00:26:51,640
Take care of it like it was a baby.

504
00:26:51,760 --> 00:26:54,800
Wow! I want to know...

505
00:26:54,920 --> 00:26:57,280
Stop asking me anything.

506
00:26:57,520 --> 00:26:59,120
Pregnant women are irritable.

507
00:26:59,280 --> 00:27:00,160
OK.

508
00:27:01,360 --> 00:27:07,080
Hello? How are you? My name is Chi.

509
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:11,440
(What are the procedures to terminate
my pregnancy?)

510
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,320
Someone called the group

511
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:19,040
about October 15 between
11p.m. and midnight,

512
00:27:19,200 --> 00:27:21,880
from Ko Cho Village to Wan Mei Village,

513
00:27:21,920 --> 00:27:23,640
she left something important in my car...

514
00:27:23,760 --> 00:27:24,480
(Tai-di)

515
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:26,960
Tai-di is beginning to suspect me.

516
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:30,400
Though I asked the driver not to
disclose anything,

517
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:33,520
they'll eventually find a way.

518
00:27:33,880 --> 00:27:35,600
Better keep this bargaining chip

519
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:37,200
to drive a wedge between them.

520
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:39,520
I should get the money soon.

521
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:41,080
I'll deal with them later.

522
00:27:49,760 --> 00:27:52,880
Grandma, did you tell her the time?

523
00:27:53,080 --> 00:27:55,440
I don't see anyone following me.

524
00:27:55,600 --> 00:27:57,360
I told her clearly

525
00:27:57,640 --> 00:27:58,960
I overheard you on the phone,

526
00:27:59,040 --> 00:28:03,520
you're meeting the sponge at
3 o'clock at Pier No. 9.

527
00:28:03,600 --> 00:28:06,800
Is it possible she's here but
we can't see her?

528
00:28:06,960 --> 00:28:08,280
Is she using a drone camera?

529
00:28:08,440 --> 00:28:13,120
No way. I've been watching the whole time.

530
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:18,760
It's not a man. It's a tomboy.

531
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:33,280
Mrs. Cheung, this is your granddaughter's
sponge boyfriend.

532
00:28:33,360 --> 00:28:34,880
He's not meeting with your granddaughter,

533
00:28:35,040 --> 00:28:37,880
but taking another girl to Macau.

534
00:28:38,040 --> 00:28:39,600
I will follow him.

535
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:42,600
But I charge more for a job
outside Hong Kong.

536
00:28:42,760 --> 00:28:44,160
I'll give you a quote later.

537
00:28:44,360 --> 00:28:46,800
Take a look at the pictures
and pay me the balance.

538
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:50,520
What? She's making this up!

539
00:28:50,800 --> 00:28:51,680
Let's go find her.

540
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:52,560
Good.

541
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:56,840
Feed her! Yes...look sweet!

542
00:28:56,960 --> 00:28:59,040
You must smile more.

543
00:28:59,160 --> 00:29:00,320
You're crazy about her

544
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:01,680
and you're hitting on her.

545
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:04,360
Yes...smile!

546
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:09,840
Henry Wong...you asked someone
to pose as the sponge?

547
00:29:09,960 --> 00:29:12,720
My granddaughter doesn't know this guy.

548
00:29:12,880 --> 00:29:15,880
You're caught red-handed for conning me.

549
00:29:16,040 --> 00:29:17,920
No, maybe I followed the wrong guy.

550
00:29:18,040 --> 00:29:20,880
Stop lying! There's no sponge.

551
00:29:21,040 --> 00:29:22,160
You couldn't have made a mistake.

552
00:29:24,440 --> 00:29:28,160
You set me up?

553
00:29:28,320 --> 00:29:30,600
We have pictures of you.

554
00:29:30,760 --> 00:29:33,640
One, you let us track you so easily,
you're very unprofessional.

555
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:36,120
Two, you asked someone to pose as
the target and took pictures,

556
00:29:36,280 --> 00:29:37,800
you're scamming the client.

557
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:40,800
We'll post this online.

558
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:44,960
Make sure we have her picture.

559
00:29:45,040 --> 00:29:47,520
Whether she's Charlie Lau or William Man,

560
00:29:47,600 --> 00:29:49,360
she'll never get another job.

561
00:29:49,480 --> 00:29:52,840
Please don't. Henry Wong is my uncle.

562
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:54,160
I work for him.

563
00:29:54,320 --> 00:29:55,760
But he suddenly fell off the grid

564
00:29:55,880 --> 00:29:56,880
and the other employees left.

565
00:29:56,960 --> 00:29:59,200
I had no choice but to take your case.

566
00:29:59,320 --> 00:30:00,880
I didn't mean to scam you.

567
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,960
My uncle didn't pay my salary,

568
00:30:03,160 --> 00:30:04,880
I was forced to do this.

569
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:09,920
No wonder there was no one else
at the agency.

570
00:30:10,120 --> 00:30:11,680
Please go easy on me.

571
00:30:11,800 --> 00:30:13,680
I have mouths to feed.

572
00:30:13,760 --> 00:30:16,320
I'll refund your money.

573
00:30:16,480 --> 00:30:21,040
You know what cases your uncle worked on?

574
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:23,920
Of course! I helped him on every case.

575
00:30:25,800 --> 00:30:28,840
OK, we can go easy on you.

576
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:33,680
But you must sell us something.

577
00:30:41,720 --> 00:30:43,840
I didn't expect that tramp

578
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:46,480
to hire someone to follow Chung

579
00:30:46,640 --> 00:30:50,040
and she found out about the trust fund.

580
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:55,200
I bet she was pissed she didn't get
all of Chung's money

581
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:59,320
and Chi and I will live in the house
until we die.

582
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:01,680
What?
Let's go to the Police

583
00:31:01,840 --> 00:31:05,440
and ask them to find the evidence
to arrest that tramp.

584
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:10,040
The jacket they found wasn't mine.

585
00:31:10,840 --> 00:31:13,200
Grandma, what's wrong? Are you feeling OK?

586
00:31:13,280 --> 00:31:16,040
I feel dizzy and weak...

587
00:31:16,160 --> 00:31:19,520
Oh dear! You're having a stroke? Sit down...

588
00:31:19,960 --> 00:31:21,360
I'll get you an ambulance.

589
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:23,080
Be careful. Hang on...

590
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:24,880
No need.
What?

591
00:31:25,040 --> 00:31:28,160
Just take me somewhere.

592
00:31:31,840 --> 00:31:36,080
You feel dizzy because of low blood sugar.

593
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,360
Does the honey lemon make you feel better?

594
00:31:37,520 --> 00:31:38,760
Yes!

595
00:31:39,120 --> 00:31:42,320
You can't read a pregnancy test.

596
00:31:42,400 --> 00:31:44,360
You have so little common sense.

597
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:46,360
How did you become a lawyer?

598
00:31:46,440 --> 00:31:50,360
You don't need to know that to be a lawyer.

599
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:53,320
The elderly cannot go hungry.

600
00:31:53,400 --> 00:31:55,200
I know now. Let's eat.

601
00:31:58,480 --> 00:31:59,880
Have a thigh.

602
00:32:05,360 --> 00:32:06,880
Let's eat...

603
00:32:07,040 --> 00:32:08,880
Let's eat...
Let's eat...

604
00:32:09,960 --> 00:32:12,760
Chi, here's a thigh for you.

605
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,240
Thanks, Mom.

606
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:19,000
Chung, one for you too.

607
00:32:19,120 --> 00:32:20,360
Thanks, Grandma.

608
00:32:20,440 --> 00:32:21,200
Good boy!

609
00:32:26,760 --> 00:32:29,920
Grandma...have some veggies.

610
00:32:30,040 --> 00:32:34,520
Good! You should eat more.

611
00:32:34,600 --> 00:32:36,480
Yes, have some chicken.

612
00:32:38,440 --> 00:32:41,200
The sweet and sour pork is good too.

613
00:32:52,480 --> 00:32:55,760
Sze Sir, what do you think of
the information Cheung Tai-di gave us?

614
00:32:55,920 --> 00:32:58,880
If Tang Suk-han was set up,

615
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:01,360
someone wanted us to find the jacket

616
00:33:01,480 --> 00:33:04,800
to prove Tang Suk-han was at the scene.

617
00:33:05,000 --> 00:33:09,280
Someone who knew Tang Suk-han wore
the jacket to identify the body.

618
00:33:09,360 --> 00:33:11,880
Leung Yuet-ping volunteered to tell us

619
00:33:12,040 --> 00:33:14,840
Tang Suk-han tossed the jacket
the day after Cheung Siu-chung died

620
00:33:14,960 --> 00:33:18,520
and that Tang Heung-nam drove
Tang Suk-han to the village house.

621
00:33:18,600 --> 00:33:21,680
Her goal was to get us to
investigate Tang Suk-han.

622
00:33:21,800 --> 00:33:27,040
It's likely Leung Yuet-ping planted
the evidence.

623
00:33:27,160 --> 00:33:31,160
Tang Suk-han said the friend who gave her
the jacket already passed away.

624
00:33:31,320 --> 00:33:33,200
Where else can we look?

625
00:33:33,320 --> 00:33:35,800
The jacket had no label.

626
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:38,480
We have no idea where it was sold.

627
00:33:38,560 --> 00:33:41,240
Did you notice their clothes have
something in common?

628
00:33:41,360 --> 00:33:44,160
One is in her 40s, the other in her 60s.

629
00:33:44,280 --> 00:33:45,880
They should have different tastes.

630
00:33:46,040 --> 00:33:48,360
What kind of handbags do they use?

631
00:33:48,520 --> 00:33:50,560
Designer brand.

632
00:33:50,880 --> 00:33:55,440
You mean they are expensive
designer jackets?

633
00:33:55,600 --> 00:33:58,400
We can find designer handbags online,

634
00:33:58,520 --> 00:34:01,760
but these jackets had no labels.

635
00:34:01,880 --> 00:34:03,520
It's hard to trace.

636
00:34:03,720 --> 00:34:05,880
Tang Suk-han's jacket may be hard to trace.

637
00:34:06,040 --> 00:34:08,480
If Leung Yuet-ping planted the evidence,

638
00:34:08,600 --> 00:34:10,560
she must know where to buy it.

639
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:13,040
Exactly! Something expensive
but had no label,

640
00:34:13,240 --> 00:34:14,320
what are the possibilities?

641
00:34:14,680 --> 00:34:18,200
A local designer?

642
00:34:19,320 --> 00:34:22,960
Hey! Didn't they put sugar?

643
00:34:24,600 --> 00:34:27,120
Thanks, Brother Bo! Get to work.

644
00:34:27,160 --> 00:34:28,080
OK.

645
00:34:28,280 --> 00:34:30,640
I designed both jackets.

646
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:33,360
From choosing the fabric, tailoring
and sewing,

647
00:34:33,480 --> 00:34:34,760
I did it all by myself.

648
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:37,840
I added pearls as details on one of them,

649
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:40,560
along the hem and the pocket opening.

650
00:34:40,720 --> 00:34:42,560
And the other one doesn't.

651
00:34:42,680 --> 00:34:44,880
They're both one of a kind.

652
00:34:44,960 --> 00:34:48,480
Can you give us the details of the buyer?

653
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:49,680
Sure.

654
00:34:51,440 --> 00:34:54,720
It was more than a year back.

655
00:34:57,040 --> 00:34:59,920
Here...the one with the pearls,

656
00:35:00,080 --> 00:35:03,240
I sold it to a granny

657
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:05,720
who said it was a gift for a friend.

658
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:07,680
She paid cash for it.

659
00:35:07,840 --> 00:35:11,120
The other was sold to a lady

660
00:35:11,240 --> 00:35:12,680
who paid with a credit card.

661
00:35:12,840 --> 00:35:16,320
The cardholder's name is Leung Yuet-ping.

662
00:35:19,280 --> 00:35:22,320
Chung's head hit the cabinet because of you!

663
00:35:22,400 --> 00:35:24,320
You shoved him into the glass cabinet.

664
00:35:24,440 --> 00:35:25,920
You meant to kill him.

665
00:35:26,080 --> 00:35:30,960
Henry Wong said she helped Leung Yuet-ping
track down Cheung Siu-chung,

666
00:35:31,080 --> 00:35:33,680
she knew about the trust fund

667
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:38,080
and Cheung Siu-chung was in Hunghom.

668
00:35:38,280 --> 00:35:41,520
Hunghom? He went to Tang Heung-nam's
coffin shop?

669
00:35:41,640 --> 00:35:42,800
I think so too.

670
00:35:42,920 --> 00:35:46,120
Leung Yuet-ping probably went to see
Cheung Siu-chung at the coffin shop.

671
00:35:46,240 --> 00:35:48,800
But Tang Heung-nam said nothing about this.

672
00:35:49,520 --> 00:35:51,440
A few days before he died,

673
00:35:51,560 --> 00:35:53,240
did Cheung Siu-chung see you here?

674
00:35:53,360 --> 00:35:54,400
No.

675
00:35:54,560 --> 00:35:56,160
Did you step out and didn't know about it?

676
00:35:56,320 --> 00:35:58,800
I don't think so.

677
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:01,920
Hey, Shing!
What?

678
00:36:02,040 --> 00:36:03,360
Did my godson come by?

679
00:36:03,520 --> 00:36:06,240
I know him. He came on October 14.

680
00:36:06,400 --> 00:36:08,560
Why do you remember it was October 14?

681
00:36:08,760 --> 00:36:11,240
Of course! I fought with my wife that day

682
00:36:11,400 --> 00:36:12,320
and she threatened to divorce me.

683
00:36:12,520 --> 00:36:14,160
Can you tell us what happened?

684
00:36:14,680 --> 00:36:15,840
He came to see Brother Nam that day.

685
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:17,040
I said Brother Nam stepped out

686
00:36:17,200 --> 00:36:18,640
and told him to come back later.

687
00:36:18,680 --> 00:36:19,680
But he didn't come back.

688
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:20,480
(The day before the incident)

689
00:36:20,640 --> 00:36:22,480
I saw him run into a woman outside

690
00:36:22,680 --> 00:36:23,920
and they started talking.

691
00:36:24,080 --> 00:36:25,760
Then my wife called me.

692
00:36:26,320 --> 00:36:27,440
She wanted a divorce,

693
00:36:27,560 --> 00:36:29,040
obviously, I was eager to coax her

694
00:36:29,200 --> 00:36:30,480
so I didn't hear what they said.

695
00:36:30,680 --> 00:36:32,800
Can you describe the woman?

696
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:34,560
I only took a glance.

697
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:37,920
Tall and slender, in her 40s.

698
00:36:38,080 --> 00:36:39,280
She was quite a looker.

699
00:36:39,400 --> 00:36:40,720
Is that her?

700
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:41,920
I think so.

701
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:46,400
Senior Constable Sze King, Crime Unit,
New Territories East.

702
00:36:46,560 --> 00:36:47,720
Officer Cheung Yau-ming.

703
00:36:47,840 --> 00:36:50,000
What is it, Officers?

704
00:36:50,120 --> 00:36:54,200
Ms. Leung Yuet-ping, we suspect you're
connected to Cheung Siu-chung's death.

705
00:36:54,360 --> 00:36:56,640
We need you to facilitate our investigation.

706
00:36:56,840 --> 00:37:00,080
Why are you arresting my wife?

707
00:37:00,240 --> 00:37:02,320
Ms. Leung, according to your last statement,

708
00:37:02,440 --> 00:37:04,680
at 9p.m. on October 15,

709
00:37:04,840 --> 00:37:06,800
you and your husband Cheung Wang-chi
were already in bed.

710
00:37:06,960 --> 00:37:10,000
We also need Mr. Cheung to help
facilitate our investigation.

711
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:11,520
What?

712
00:37:14,200 --> 00:37:15,440
Where's my husband?

713
00:37:15,520 --> 00:37:17,840
Relax. Our colleagues are with him.

714
00:37:17,960 --> 00:37:19,920
We wish to take your statement.

715
00:37:20,280 --> 00:37:28,640
On October 15, between 10:45p.m.
and 12:30a.m. on October 16,

716
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:31,280
which was Cheung Siu-chung's time of death,

717
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:33,440
did you go to Wan Mei Village?

718
00:37:34,040 --> 00:37:35,720
I already told you,

719
00:37:35,840 --> 00:37:38,120
my husband and I were asleep at home.

720
00:37:38,320 --> 00:37:40,680
We checked the surveillance cameras

721
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:42,720
from Ko Cho Village to Wan Mei Village,

722
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:46,480
we saw a taxi with the license plate WK206

723
00:37:46,680 --> 00:37:49,160
came out of Ko Cho Village.

724
00:37:49,280 --> 00:37:50,680
We followed this taxi,

725
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:54,400
it got onto Man Nin Street

726
00:37:54,560 --> 00:37:57,440
and then went to Wan Mei Village.

727
00:37:57,600 --> 00:38:00,080
We checked, the taxi got onto Man Nin Street

728
00:38:00,240 --> 00:38:01,840
and stopped in front of a convenience store.

729
00:38:02,040 --> 00:38:05,120
According to our record, you went
inside the convenience store

730
00:38:05,240 --> 00:38:08,480
because you paid with your member app.

731
00:38:08,680 --> 00:38:10,320
The salesclerk also confirmed

732
00:38:10,480 --> 00:38:13,160
you boarded WK206 and left.

733
00:38:13,320 --> 00:38:17,160
You claimed you never went to
Cheung Siu-chung's village house,

734
00:38:17,280 --> 00:38:20,320
then how come we heard you
at the mourning hall

735
00:38:20,440 --> 00:38:24,800
accusing Tang Suk-han of shoving
Cheung Siu-chung into the glass cabinet?

736
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:26,480
If you were never there,

737
00:38:26,640 --> 00:38:28,160
how did you know there was
a glass cabinet?

738
00:38:29,480 --> 00:38:31,640
I don't recall saying that.

739
00:38:34,400 --> 00:38:38,640
We compared the jacket found in
Tang Suk-han's room

740
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:41,920
with the pictures she took when she
wore it to a gathering.

741
00:38:42,080 --> 00:38:43,720
We noticed it was a different jacket.

742
00:38:43,880 --> 00:38:47,680
Hers had pearl trimmings.

743
00:38:47,880 --> 00:38:50,880
The one found in her room did not.

744
00:38:51,360 --> 00:38:55,280
Both jackets were made by Joyce Lee,
a local designer.

745
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:59,720
We checked, you bought one of them
with your credit card.

746
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:01,680
We have reasons to suspect

747
00:39:01,840 --> 00:39:05,440
you knew Tan Suk-han went to
the village house that night

748
00:39:05,600 --> 00:39:08,560
and wore that jacket to identify the body,

749
00:39:08,720 --> 00:39:12,240
so you planted your jacket in her room

750
00:39:12,400 --> 00:39:17,040
to mislead the Police into thinking
Tang Suk-han killed Cheung Siu-chung.

751
00:39:17,280 --> 00:39:19,240
Separately, we also found out,

752
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:21,240
after Cheung Siu-chung ran away from home,

753
00:39:21,360 --> 00:39:23,600
you hired a private detective
to track him down.

754
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:26,000
That's why before Cheung Siu-chung died,

755
00:39:26,120 --> 00:39:28,160
you already knew about the trust fund.

756
00:39:28,320 --> 00:39:31,280
Near Tang Heung-nam's coffin shop in Hunghom

757
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:33,680
a staff member confirmed you had an
argument with Cheung Siu-chung.

758
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:35,640
We have reasons to believe

759
00:39:35,760 --> 00:39:37,760
you were not happy with Cheung Siu-chung's
allocation of the assets,

760
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:38,960
you went to the village house to kill him

761
00:39:39,080 --> 00:39:41,440
and took the second document
of the trust fund.

762
00:39:44,760 --> 00:39:49,440
I admit I saw Chung at the village house

763
00:39:49,600 --> 00:39:55,920
to persuade him to re-allocate
the assets in the trust fund.

764
00:39:56,080 --> 00:39:57,840
But he wouldn't listen to me.

765
00:39:58,040 --> 00:40:01,360
I was so angry I left.

766
00:40:01,520 --> 00:40:03,640
He was still alive when I left.

767
00:40:04,440 --> 00:40:06,880
I didn't say anything before,

768
00:40:07,040 --> 00:40:10,880
because I was afraid you'd suspect me.

769
00:40:13,120 --> 00:40:18,400
I want to see my wife...

770
00:40:18,560 --> 00:40:22,240
Calm down...take a deep breath! Sit down.

771
00:40:24,600 --> 00:40:28,640
I need to see my wife...

772
00:40:28,680 --> 00:40:36,880
I must see my wife...
Calm down...Calm down, Sir!

773
00:40:37,120 --> 00:40:38,760
Please calm down...

774
00:40:38,880 --> 00:40:45,280
Please sit back down...

775
00:40:46,080 --> 00:40:47,520
Kwan Sir! Lee Sir!

776
00:40:47,600 --> 00:40:48,840
Something wrong with this guy...

777
00:40:48,880 --> 00:40:52,000
What's wrong? Hold him down...

778
00:40:52,120 --> 00:40:55,440
Why did you put the jacket
in Tang Suk-han's room?

779
00:40:55,920 --> 00:40:57,760
Sze Sir, Cheung Wang-chi clutched his heart

780
00:40:57,880 --> 00:40:58,680
and complained about chest pain.

781
00:40:58,800 --> 00:41:00,320
We called an ambulance to
take him to the hospital.

782
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:01,640
I need to see my husband.

783
00:41:01,800 --> 00:41:02,680
Not now.

784
00:41:02,840 --> 00:41:05,640
No, he has the mental age of an 8-year-old.

785
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:06,960
He has never been to a Police station,

786
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:08,240
he must be terrified.

787
00:41:08,360 --> 00:41:10,240
Is he having a heart attack?

788
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:12,880
He could die! Please let me see him.

789
00:41:13,080 --> 00:41:15,120
Only I can calm him down.

790
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:16,560
Please, Sir!

791
00:41:16,680 --> 00:41:19,520
OK, we'll go with her.

792
00:41:19,680 --> 00:41:22,800
Call his family. Maybe they can watch him.

793
00:41:22,960 --> 00:41:24,560
We'll finish taking your statement later.

794
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:25,600
Thank you.

795
00:41:25,920 --> 00:41:29,040
We have examined Cheung Wang-chi. He's fine.

796
00:41:29,400 --> 00:41:31,920
But he's emotionally unstable
and kept saying he had chest pain.

797
00:41:32,040 --> 00:41:34,080
So we took him to the ward for
further examinations.

798
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:35,840
Take me to my wife. I want to see my wife...

799
00:41:36,040 --> 00:41:37,320
Mr Cheung...
I don't want to see you.

800
00:41:37,400 --> 00:41:39,840
Tell them to leave.
I don't want to see them.

801
00:41:40,000 --> 00:41:40,800
Sir, please lie down, OK?
Calm down...

802
00:41:40,920 --> 00:41:42,640
Sze Sir, Cheung Sir, my husband
is emotionally unstable.

803
00:41:42,760 --> 00:41:45,040
Can you step outside
and let me calm him down?

804
00:41:45,160 --> 00:41:46,880
Don't do this...

805
00:41:47,000 --> 00:41:50,480
No! Go away...I don't want to see them...

806
00:41:50,640 --> 00:41:54,560
OK...they're gone.

807
00:41:54,960 --> 00:41:59,680
It's OK, I'm here...

808
00:42:06,160 --> 00:42:08,560
Sir, how is my son?

809
00:42:08,720 --> 00:42:10,400
He seems to have calmed down.

810
00:42:10,520 --> 00:42:11,640
I want to see him.

811
00:42:11,760 --> 00:42:12,640
Sure.

812
00:42:15,080 --> 00:42:16,160
Chi!

813
00:42:16,320 --> 00:42:17,200
Dad!

814
00:42:17,720 --> 00:42:20,880
My wife didn't kill Chung B.

815
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:26,480
I did.

816
00:42:28,840 --> 00:42:29,920
What?
